{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1440156-please-help-me-construct-an-etherite-specific-version-of-the-echoes-flaw","id":1440156,"title":"Please help me construct an Etherite specific version of the Echoes flaw","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-16T00:30:03-07:00","id":1440156,"title":"Please help me construct an Etherite specific version of the Echoes flaw","content":"I have a vague idea of how it should go. Like, level 1 might be that your hair always looks like you've been electrocuted no matter how much you comb it, and you smell of ozone or other chemicals no matter how often you bath. Past that, it's hard to come up with specific echoes that fit Society of Ether mages at the 3, 4, and 5 marks.<br /> <br /> Thank you in advance for your help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T01:45:43-07:00","id":1440165,"title":"","content":"Burns on clothing, as well as mysterious stains.<br /> <br /> Mad Scientists seem weirdly intense in old films either that or icy calm/ flat aspected. Perhaps the echoes flaw would make an Eitherite seem either maniacal or unemotional to an unnatural degree.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T08:14:18-07:00","id":1440202,"title":"","content":"Storm brews whenever you're home<br /> UFO ligths in the sky follow you<br /> Psychic phenomena (stuff levitates, burns, etc)<br /> Sci-Fy sound effects, or perhaps organ sounds and man\u00edacal laughter, follow you arround<br /> Your body emits vapor, electricity, or whatever reaction it's appropiate for your Paradigm","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T08:18:15-07:00","id":1440203,"title":"","content":"When you get excited, a lightning bolt happens somewhere outside (but not under your control).<br /> When you encounter a new mystery, a theremin plays.<br /> You smell like the Ether (whatever that smells like).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 03-16-2021, 11:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T09:37:51-07:00","id":1440213,"title":"","content":"Those all sound good. Now I just need to organize them into appropriate levels.<br /> <br /> (1) A vague scent of ozone follows you around. Your hair tends to go wild within a few hours of you combing it.<br /> <br /> (2) A strong scent of ozone and burning follows you around. Your hair tends to go wild within minutes of you combing it. People sometimes get a mild impression of you being crazy even if you are perfectly calm.<br /> <br /> (3) A strong scent of ozone and burning follows you around. Your hair tends to go wild within minutes of you combing it. Most people think you crazy even if you are perfectly calm. Pitchforks and torches cause you to need to make a willpower roll to be around.<br /> <br /> (4)A strong scent of ozone and burning follows you around. Your hair tends to go wild within minutes of you combing it. Most people think you crazy even if you are perfectly calm. Pitchforks and torches cause you to need to make a willpower roll to be around. People familiar with mad scientist fiction can find a red self destruct button on your devices even though you never installed such a button.<br /> <br /> (5)A strong scent of ozone and burning follows you around. Your hair tends to go wild within minutes of you combing it. Most people think you crazy even if you are perfectly calm. Pitchforks and torches cause you to need to make a willpower roll to be around. People familiar with mad scientist fiction can find a red self destruct button on your devices even though you never installed such a button. Lightning crackles in the sky when you get excited. UFO lights in the sky follow you. Psychic phenomena, such as randomly levitating objects, happen around you. When you encounter a new mystery, or make a new discovery/invention, organ music or theremin music plays. Maniacal laughter follows you around.<br /> <br /> Does that sound good?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-18T04:32:34-07:00","id":1440445,"title":"","content":"I'd replace the pitchforks and torches with a compulsion to Monologue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-18T11:17:26-07:00","id":1440474,"title":"","content":"Monologuing always leads to death.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-18T11:32:09-07:00","id":1440477,"title":"","content":"In retrospect, torches and pitchforks are probably too rare to be meaningful. Maybe replace it will, &quot;you need a willpower to remain around angry crowds, even when they are unrelated to you like a union going on strike.&quot; That would severely limit someone from, say, helping that PETA protest that your Verbena friend is backing and wants your help supporting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-13T06:33:27-08:00","id":1474561,"title":"","content":"I'm about to use this in a game, so I was wondering if anyone had any fresh ideas about it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-14T09:47:30-08:00","id":1474632,"title":"","content":"Anything they say beyond one- to three-word phrases, is muddled with technobabble. Whether the Echo causes the Etherite to speak the technobabble, or the Echoes simply make what they say <i>sound </i>or be heard/understood by others as technobabble, would be up to the ST's particular interpretation of what Echoes are and how they function or operate.<br /> <br /> Systematically, this could require that people trying to understand the Etherite make a roll of some kind to decipher what the hell they're saying (think a base difficult, +/- 3 depending on how familiar they are with the Etherite and their particular brand of technobabble.) You could also have this sort of Echo, all on its own, exist at multiple levels of severity, with higher or lower levels dictating everything from the base difficulty of the roll I mentioned, to the sorts of phrases that are even affected in the first place (i.e., higher Echoes would mean a larger category of phrases and speech are effected; so at a high level of Echoes, even asking where the bathroom is would be turned into impenetrable techno word salad; at a low level, only technical or tactical discussions.)<br /> <br /> EDIT: could make for some fantastic RP as people just recite inane Star Trek dialogue about reversing polarities, EPS conduits, and plasma-intake manifolds.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sig","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2319-captotter","name":"CaptOtter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2319_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"405"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-14T17:22:43-08:00","id":1474666,"title":"","content":"Echoes reflect the collective unconscious. So a Mad Scientist would have echoes reflecting that archetype. In the West this might be the smell of ozone and electrical crackling. Hospital smells like antiseptics would be more common in Latin America. You'd need to scan the popular culture of the area your campaign is set in for a definitive answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}